  "bodyTextSample": "Skip to content ✨LIMITED INVENTORY: RESTOCK COMING LATE FALL ✨ Search Log in Cart Shop Discover Find Your Fit CLOSEOUT SALE EVO CHEST WADER 22 reviews Regular price $229.00 Shipping calculated at checkout. SIZE Petite/Slim Petite/Curvy Petite/Full Petite/Plus Average/Slim Average/Curvy Average/Full Average/Plus Tall/Slim Tall/Curvy Tall/Full Tall/Plus Average Tall/Extra Plus SIZE CHART ADD TO CART Easy Return & Exchange Mayfly-Tough Guarantee Award-Winning Comfort LIMITED INVENTORY: SELECT SIZES RESTOCKED IN LATE OCTOBER Premium performance, accessible price. The EVO Chest Wader delivers everything you love about Miss Mayfly—thoughtful design, reliable performance, women-specific fit—at a price that makes getting on the water easier. FIT SPECS & FEATURES MATERIAL & CARE SHIPPING & RETURNS CUSTOMER REVIEWS 4.77 out of 5 Based on 22 reviews 20 1 0 0 1 Customer photos & videos SORT BY Most Recent Highest Rating Lowest Rating Only Pictures Pictures First Videos First Most Helpful 08/06/2026 Michael S. Conquering the Kenai River, Alaska It was difficult to find my girlfriend a quality pair of waders until I discovered Miss Mayfly. They're stylish, form-fitting, comfortable, and come in a great color! The customer service was outstanding, especially when we needed to exchange them for a better-fitting pair. After a couple of trial runs in Colorado, we finally had the chance to put them to the test in Alaska. Miss Mayfly waders exceeded our expectations and outperformed every other pair we've tried. They kept her comfortable and dry through long days on the water while chasing sockeye salmon and rainbow trout. The fish didn't stand a chance! Thanks, Miss Mayfly, for making such an excellent product and for providing exceptional customer service. She couldn't be happier! 07/14/2026 Heather Johns The waders are the perfect fit The waders are the perfect fit. I was concerned of not having enough room available in the thigh area, when sitting down in my float tube. No worries at all. It’s nice having the proper shoe size on the booties as well. Thank you for an awesome product! 06/02/2026 Anonymous Gift Gift for my daughter so I can have a fly-fishing buddy! She loves them. Great fit. 06/01/2026 Anonymous Thanks for making women’s waders Thanks for making women’s waders that are affordable!!! 05/27/2026 Wendy Thank you for creating a product for everyone!! Haven't had the opportunity to use them yet Thank you for creating a product for everyone!! Haven't had the opportunity to use them yet, but I did wear them for about 30 minutes and they felt great!! 123 YOU MAY ALSO LIKE EVO Chest Wader 22 reviews $229.00 Miss Mayfly® Moxie Wading Pant© 71 reviews $349.00 Miss Mayfly® MOXIE Chest Wader© 56 reviews $429.00 YOU MAY ALSO LIKE SAVE 57% Miss Mayfly® MOXIE Wading Boot©, Felt- Blue 8 reviews Regular price $229.00 Sale price $99.00 Miss Mayfly® Moxie Wading Pant© 71 reviews $349.00 Miss Mayfly® MOXIE Chest Wader© 56 reviews $429.00 SAVE 57% Miss Mayfly® MOXIE Wading Boot©, Rubber- Blue 12 reviews Regular price $229.00 Sale price $99.00 SAVE 57% Miss Mayfly® MOXIE Wading Boot©, Felt- Sage 5 reviews Regular price $229.00 Sale price $99.00 Help Center Shipping Policy Exchange, Return & Refund Policy Warranty & Repair Policy The Wading Room Miss Mayfly Privacy Policy Miss Mayfly Terms of Service ReelFit 360° Privacy Policy ReelFit 360° Terms of Use Find a Retailer JOIN THE JOURNEY You may hear a fish story - or two - plus you'll gain exclusive access to email-only offers and fresh new product releases! Enter your email Subscribe Subscribe Instagram Facebook YouTube © 2026 Miss Mayfly Women's Fishing and Wading Gear Warrenton, Virginia USAPowered by Shopify YOUR CART Close Cart AWARD-WINNING FIT. LIMITED STOCK. DON'T WAIT! YOUR CART IS EMPTY WE'RE READY WHEN YOU ARE — LET’S MAKE YOUR NEXT ADVENTURE HAPPEN. Shop Now",
